# lctl - firefox (actions/firefox/firefox_lctl.kbd)
**lctl + tab** -- Walk Through Apps
**lctl + `**   -- Walk Through Same App
**lctl + 1**   -- Tabs Goto 1 (A-1)
**lctl + 2**   -- Tabs Goto 2 (A-2)
**lctl + 3**   -- Tabs Goto 3 (A-3)
**lctl + 4**   -- Tabs Goto 4 (A-4)
**lctl + 5**   -- Tabs Goto 5 (A-5)
**lctl + 6**   -- Tabs Goto 6 (A-6)
**lctl + 7**   -- Tabs Goto 7 (A-7)
**lctl + 8**   -- Tabs Goto 8 (A-8)
**lctl + 9**   -- Tabs Goto 9 (A-9)
**lctl + 0**   -- Tabs Goto 0 (C-0)
